<!-- ══ WHERE YOU ARE NOW ══ -->
<section class="wy" id="stage">
  <div class="wy-track" id="wyTrack">
    <div class="wy-sticky">
      <div class="wy-in">
        <div class="wy-head rv">
          <div class="wy-tagwrap">
            <span class="wy-tag">Where You Are Now</span>
            <span class="mark" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>
          </div>
          <h2 class="wy-h">We help founders hit their milestones faster.</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="wy-panel">
          <div class="wy-left" id="wyList">
          <article class="wy-item" data-i="0">
            <h3 class="wy-title">Get to PMF Fast</h3>
            <div class="wy-body"><div><div class="wy-bodyIn">
              <p class="wy-copy">Startups that reach PMF faster often become market leaders. We help you bring your product out of the lab and find you a PMF with real audiences and real feedback.</p>
              <div class="wy-cardwrap">
                <div class="wy-card">
                  <div>
                    <span class="wy-stat">1 Month</span>
                    <p class="wy-quote">&ldquo;A health tech startup that built its first 10,000-subscriber base before a single rupee was spent on ads.&rdquo;</p>
                  </div>
                  <a class="wy-read" href="#featured">Read full story <span class="wy-mark" aria-hidden="true"><i style="--x:0;--y:0"></i><i style="--x:1;--y:0"></i><i style="--x:2;--y:0"></i><i style="--x:1;--y:1"></i><i style="--x:2;--y:1"></i><i style="--x:2;--y:2"></i></span></a>
                </div>
                <span class="wy-client">Jumpp</span>
              </div>
            </div></div></div>
          </article>
          <article class="wy-item" data-i="1">
            <h3 class="wy-title">Reach Scale Targets Months Early</h3>
            <div class="wy-body"><div><div class="wy-bodyIn">
              <p class="wy-copy">Scaling early breaks in predictable places. We have usually already seen the break before it happens, and we build for it ahead of time.</p>
              <div class="wy-cardwrap">
                <div class="wy-card">
                  <div>
                    <span class="wy-stat">4 Months</span>
                    <p class="wy-quote">&ldquo;Selling 500 units a day within a month of launch, well ahead of what the plan allowed for.&rdquo;</p>
                  </div>
                  <a class="wy-read" href="#featured">Read full story <span class="wy-mark" aria-hidden="true"><i style="--x:0;--y:0"></i><i style="--x:1;--y:0"></i><i style="--x:2;--y:0"></i><i style="--x:1;--y:1"></i><i style="--x:2;--y:1"></i><i style="--x:2;--y:2"></i></span></a>
                </div>
                <span class="wy-client">Helium</span>
              </div>
            </div></div></div>
          </article>
          <article class="wy-item" data-i="2">
            <h3 class="wy-title">Control CAC and Grow Sustainably</h3>
            <div class="wy-body"><div><div class="wy-bodyIn">
              <p class="wy-copy">This is rarely a spend problem. It is a transparency problem &mdash; knowing exactly where the money is going and what it is returning.</p>
              <div class="wy-cardwrap">
                <div class="wy-card">
                  <div>
                    <span class="wy-stat">&minus;38% CAC</span>
                    <p class="wy-quote">&ldquo;Acquisition cost cut by more than a third while revenue kept climbing month on month.&rdquo;</p>
                  </div>
                  <a class="wy-read" href="#featured">Read full story <span class="wy-mark" aria-hidden="true"><i style="--x:0;--y:0"></i><i style="--x:1;--y:0"></i><i style="--x:2;--y:0"></i><i style="--x:1;--y:1"></i><i style="--x:2;--y:1"></i><i style="--x:2;--y:2"></i></span></a>
                </div>
                <span class="wy-client">Masai</span>
              </div>
            </div></div></div>
          </article>
          <article class="wy-item" data-i="3">
            <h3 class="wy-title">Build Brand and Grow Organically</h3>
            <div class="wy-body"><div><div class="wy-bodyIn">
              <p class="wy-copy">Category leadership isn&rsquo;t a campaign. It&rsquo;s what&rsquo;s left after the campaigns stop and people still remember you.</p>
              <div class="wy-cardwrap">
                <div class="wy-card">
                  <div>
                    <span class="wy-stat">3&times; recall</span>
                    <p class="wy-quote">&ldquo;The awareness layer that carried the brand from Series B all the way to acquisition.&rdquo;</p>
                  </div>
                  <a class="wy-read" href="#featured">Read full story <span class="wy-mark" aria-hidden="true"><i style="--x:0;--y:0"></i><i style="--x:1;--y:0"></i><i style="--x:2;--y:0"></i><i style="--x:1;--y:1"></i><i style="--x:2;--y:1"></i><i style="--x:2;--y:2"></i></span></a>
                </div>
                <span class="wy-client">Testbook</span>
              </div>
            </div></div></div>
          </article>
          </div>
          <div class="wy-boardwrap" aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="wy-grid" id="wyGrid">
            <span class="wy-cell"></span>
            <span class="wy-cell"></span>
            <span class="wy-cell"></span>
            <span class="wy-cell"></span>
            <span class="wy-cell"></span>
            <span class="wy-cell"></span>
            <span class="wy-cell"></span>
            <span class="wy-cell"></span>
            <span class="wy-cell"></span>
            <span class="wy-cell"></span>
            <span class="wy-cell"></span>
            <span class="wy-cell"></span>
            <span class="wy-cell"></span>
            <span class="wy-cell"></span>
            <span class="wy-cell"></span>
            <span class="wy-cell"></span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ══ THE LEVERS ══ -->
<section class="lev" id="levers">
  <div class="lev-track" id="levTrack">
    <div class="lev-stage" id="levStage">
