  <div class="cs-head rv">
    <div class="cs-tagwrap">
      <span class="cs-tag">Case study</span>
      <span class="mark" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>
    </div>
    <h2 class="cs-h">Deep Dives</h2>
    <p class="cs-sub">The latest stories, ideas, and shifts worth paying attention to.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="cs-deck" id="csDeck">
      <article class="cs-card on" data-i="0">
        <div class="cs-cardL">
          <div>
            <div class="cs-brand">Curious<em>Jr</em></div>
            <h3 class="cs-title">Seekho reached 1M+ users in 12 months.</h3>
            <p class="cs-copy">We rebuilt the acquisition funnel from the ground up, focusing on regional influencers and hyper-local performance creatives.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="cs-stats">
            <span class="cs-band cs-band-a"></span>
            <span class="cs-band cs-band-b"></span>
            <span class="cs-fig cs-fig-a"><b>4.2x</b><span>ROAS improvement</span></span>
            <span class="cs-fig cs-fig-b"><b>&minus;65%</b><span>Acquisition cost</span></span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <span class="cs-shot"><img src="selected/c.png" alt="" loading="lazy" width="326" height="336"></span>
      </article>
      <article class="cs-card" data-i="1">
        <div class="cs-cardL">
          <div>
            <div class="cs-brand">Helium</div>
            <h3 class="cs-title">Helium sold 500 units a day within a month of launch.</h3>
            <p class="cs-copy">We found the audience before the spend did, then scaled only the creative that was already earning its place.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="cs-stats">
            <span class="cs-band cs-band-a"></span>
            <span class="cs-band cs-band-b"></span>
            <span class="cs-fig cs-fig-a"><b>500/day</b><span>Units sold</span></span>
            <span class="cs-fig cs-fig-b"><b>4 Months</b><span>To Series A</span></span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <span class="cs-shot"><img src="selected/a.png" alt="" loading="lazy" width="326" height="336"></span>
      </article>
      <article class="cs-card" data-i="2">
        <div class="cs-cardL">
          <div>
            <div class="cs-brand">Vyapar</div>
            <h3 class="cs-title">Vyapar grew 3&times; revenue in eight months.</h3>
            <p class="cs-copy">We turned a billing tool into a name small businesses pass along to each other unprompted.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="cs-stats">
            <span class="cs-band cs-band-a"></span>
            <span class="cs-band cs-band-b"></span>
            <span class="cs-fig cs-fig-a"><b>3x</b><span>Revenue growth</span></span>
            <span class="cs-fig cs-fig-b"><b>8 Months</b><span>Time to scale</span></span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <span class="cs-shot"><img src="selected/b.png" alt="" loading="lazy" width="326" height="336"></span>
      </article>
  </div>

