          </div>
          </div>
          <div class="fo-step">
          <div class="fo-stat">
            <b>IIT KANPUR<br>FOUNDERS + TEAM</b>
            <p>Founders + core team with a pedigree that sets Vidrow apart from traditional agencies.</p>
          </div>
          </div>
          <div class="fo-step">
          <div class="fo-stat">
            <b>Forbes<br>30 under 30 | ASIA</b>
            <p>Recognition that signals our founders are building with people who’ve been noticed</p>
